      App --- View
      App --- HMI
      App --- Runtime
      Runtime -->|semantic tools| World
      World -->|complete raw input image| Connector
      Connector -->|outputs/status + applied-image acknowledgement| World
      Runtime -->|all source records| Evidence
    end
    subgraph PLC["CODESYS CONTROL WIN · ACTUAL PLC TARGET"]
      Interceptor["Demo interceptor FB<br/>Raw input selection before application conditioning"]
      Logic["Actual PLC application<br/>Own scan/timers · scaling/filtering/logic"]
      Capture["Authentic output capture<br/>Commands + status + applied acknowledgement"]
      Interceptor --> Logic --> Capture
    end
    Spec --> App
